{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "77538150-b4a5-822a-9c29-657235011277",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:08:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Neusa Tavares",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:03:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:03:47-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin. Yes, my name is Neusa Tavares, and I'm calling about a storm drain. First, it's flooded. Second, it's at the end of my block. And third, I'd like somebody to come clean it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:04:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure, let me grab a pen. Storm drain, end of the block. What's the address or the street you're on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:04:13-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm at 244 Eustis Avenue, up on Historic Hill. The low spot is at the bottom of the block, where the road dips down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:04:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eustis Avenue, two forty-four. Got it. And is this from the nor'easter over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:04:31-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the nor'easter that ended Saturday, two days ago. The rain stopped, but the water did not go anywhere. It's still sitting there, and I don't like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:04:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still sitting there as of today, Monday. How deep are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:04:50-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About a foot. I'd say a foot, easily. First, it covers the whole dip. Second, it's up over the grate, so you can't even see the drain. And third, the leaves are all packed in around it, I could see that much from the edge."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:05:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll do it. Leaves clog those right up this time of year. [pause] Are you looking at it right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:05:20-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, I'm not home. I'm at a garden center, just browsing the houseplants, I needed to get out of the house for a bit. But I walked down there this morning, and I took photos."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:05:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Photos help us a lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:05:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can send them to you. I have three of them. Do you want them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:05:47-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Definitely. I'll give you an address to send them to. Hang on, let me finish these notes first. So, drain at the bottom of Eustis, about a foot of standing water, covered grate, leaves. Anything else, like is it reaching any driveways or houses?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:06:07-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet, thank goodness. But it's close to the sidewalk on the one side, and cars have to drive through it. First, I worry somebody will stall out. Second, I worry about the houses down there. Third, if we get more rain this week, it'll be worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:06:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put it in as a drain cleaning request, and I'll flag that there's standing water on the road so they see it's not just routine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:06:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. That's what I'm asking for. Please clean the drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:06:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. Now, do you want a call back when it's scheduled? What's a good number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:06:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It's 401-555-0192. That's my cell, so if it cuts out, call again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:06:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one nine two. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:07:05-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:07:06-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. For the photos, I'll have you text or email them to the Public Works office. Let me read you the way to do it. Actually, hold on, let me check which one the crew supervisor prefers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:07:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. I'll wait. I'm only looking at a fern."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:07:28-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. Easiest is you reply with them when we call you back, and I'll note in the ticket that photos are coming. Or if you'd rather, just have them ready on your phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:07:44-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. I'll keep them ready. First, I'll keep the phone on. Second, I'll keep the photos. Third, I'll look at the drain again tonight to see if it's gone down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:07:58-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds like a plan. And if it starts coming up toward a house, call us right back, or if it's an emergency, call 911."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:08:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you, Kevin. I appreciate you writing it all down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:08:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Ms. Tavares. Eustis Avenue, drain at the low spot, request is in. Take care, enjoy the plants."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:08:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
